#: apps/punches/corrections.py:134
msgid ""
"Art. 4.b: a change needs the authorisation of the company and of the person "
"concerned. Empty means they have not answered."
msgstr ""
"Art. 4.b: modificar un asiento necesita la autorización de la empresa y de "
"la persona afectada. Vacío significa que aún no ha respondido."

