msgstr "respondió el"

#: apps/punches/corrections.py:140
msgid "the person's account"
msgstr "versión de la persona"

#: apps/punches/corrections.py:143
msgid ""
"Their version, kept beside the change and never instead of it. Art. 4.b lets "
"the company record the modification and the person their disagreement, so "
"the record holds both."
msgstr ""
"Su versión, guardada junto al cambio y nunca en su lugar. El art. 4.b "
"permite que la empresa refleje la modificación y la persona su discrepancia, "
"de modo que el registro conserva las dos."

#: apps/punches/corrections.py:150
msgid "workers' representatives informed at"
msgstr "representación legal informada el"

#: apps/punches/corrections.py:153
msgid "how they were informed"
msgstr "cómo se les informó"

#: apps/punches/corrections.py:157
msgid ""
"Art. 4.b requires informing the workers' legal representation when there is "
"disagreement. If the company has not said who they are, that is recorded "
"here rather than passed over in silence."
msgstr ""
"El art. 4.b exige informar a la representación legal de las personas "
"trabajadoras cuando hay discrepancia. Si la empresa no ha dicho quiénes son, "
"queda anotado aquí en vez de pasarlo por alto."

#: apps/punches/corrections.py:164
msgid "applied without agreement"
msgstr "aplicada sin acuerdo"

#: apps/punches/corrections.py:167
msgid ""
"The change went in anyway, which art. 4.b allows. It travels to the "
"inspection report: a reader has to be able to tell a correction both parties "
"accepted from one imposed over an objection."
msgstr ""
"El cambio se aplicó igualmente, cosa que el art. 4.b permite. Viaja al "
"informe de Inspección: quien lo lea tiene que poder distinguir una "
"corrección aceptada por las dos partes de una impuesta sobre una objeción."

