"%(limit)s h allowed."
msgstr ""
"Un trabajador nocturno con un promedio de %(average)s h diarias en %(days)s "
"días, por encima de las %(limit)s h permitidas."

#: apps/shifts/services.py:863
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Averaging %(average)s h a day over %(days)s days. The roster reads like "
"night work, and if the status applies that is above the %(limit)s h of art. "
